+# HK independent execution review reader contract
+
+This change adds a read-only consumer. It does not create a review or promote
+the 2026-10-15 10:30 report, whose boundary remains `CANNOT_CONFIRM`.
+
+## Fixed artifact location and identity
+
+Under the already configured receipt root, the reader derives these paths only
+from the validated date and stage key:
+
+```text
+independent_execution_reviews/{YYYYMMDD}/{STAGE_ID}/attestation.json
+independent_execution_reviews/{YYYYMMDD}/{STAGE_ID}/index.json
+```
+
+`index.json` must contain `schema_version=stage_center.independent_execution_review_index.v1`,
+the exact date and stage, the exact derived `attestation.json` relative path, and
+the attestation's raw-byte SHA-256. The reader uses `SafeRoot`, a 1 MiB bound,
+no-follow path handling, duplicate-key rejection, and rereads every bound file
+before returning.
+
+`attestation.json` uses
+`schema_version=stage_center.independent_execution_review.v1` and binds:
+
+- exact `trade_date`, `stage_id`, `runner=stage_center`, a nonempty ordered
+  `scope_markets` subset, `reviewer_identity_or_role`, the review verifier's
+  SHA-256, and an explicit UTC `reviewed_at_utc`;
+- the exact runner receipt relative path and raw SHA, plus exact immutable owner
+  history path and raw SHA;
+- for every market in scope, the current SelectionStore run ID, artifact,
+  manifest and receipt relative paths, byte SHA values, and canonical manifest
+  and receipt SHA values;
+- the complete current selection `source_evidence` SHA and one or more source
+  descriptors (`identity`, exact evidence `path`, raw `sha256`, `cutoff`,
+  `temporal_semantics`, and exact `evidence_entries`). Source files must remain
+  under the configured SelectionStore parent root; each is read and hashed;
+- a dispatch object matching the contemporaneous attempt ID, attempt-start
+  path/SHA, one-attempt count, scheduler due minute, and evaluated/observed
+  clocks; and exactly `RESEARCH_ONLY=true`, `production_allowed=false`,
+  `buy_gate_updated=false`, `orders_sent=false`.
+
+The dispatch must be `NATURAL` and `DUE`, both clocks must fall inside the same
+scheduled minute, and replay, backfill, manual, late catch-up, repeated attempt,
+clock conflict, incomplete source, safety conflict, changed byte, or scope
+mismatch fails closed. Review publication may occur after a natural event only
+to attest its immutable contemporaneous evidence; it cannot make a manual,
+replayed, or backfilled event natural.
+
+## Projection boundary
+
+`operating_execution_by_market` reports only the exact attested market scope.
+An HK-only review may establish an HK operating fact while aggregate
+`execution_verified` and `natural_verified` stay false for an A+HK stage.
+Aggregate booleans can become true only when the review covers every market
+declared by that stage and all bindings pass. Stage 8 is HK-only by its frozen
+contract. These booleans do not change `formal_eligible`, PIT/temporal safety,
+production readiness, BUY, or order state. Four-lane HK rows with
+`formal_eligible=false` remain research observations; that status does not
+mean quote collection failed.
+
+The index proves byte consistency only. This repository has no signature or
+trusted-root mechanism for reviewer identity. A distinct reviewer must create
+the attestation under a separate identity; the controller must verify that
+identity, verifier-code SHA, and both raw files, then publish the two files
+once to the derived directory and read back their SHAs. No runner, UI request,
+report-level `PASS`, or this reader may synthesize the attestation.
+
+For the 10:30 case, the independent reviewer must first verify the original
+runner receipt, owner history, each in-scope selection trio and source, exact
+cutoff semantics, one-shot scheduler evidence, clocks, and safety flags from
+their current bytes. The existing 10:30 JSON report lacks the required
+machine-readable identity/code binding and remains supporting evidence only.
+If any source, identity, clock, or natural-schedule fact cannot be independently
+rechecked, publish no acceptance artifact and retain `CANNOT_CONFIRM` with the
+specific missing reason.
